  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Tradition of the mestvire, itinerant Georgian bard-musicians who sang humorous, satirical and topical verses to the gudastviri, a bagpipe with a skin bag and a double chanter, notably in Racha and Kartli; in Adjara the related bagpipe is the chiboni, and the chiboni card, set to its gudastviri form, stands for the gudastviri.",
